WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.713
Every difference between runs
lands in one of five results.

2
00:00:03.713 --> 00:00:06.337
New and changed findings open issues.

3
00:00:06.337 --> 00:00:09.963
A change only in the detail is
recorded but opens nothing.

4
00:00:09.963 --> 00:00:14.463
A finding is resolved only when its
check actually read the tenant this run.

5
00:00:14.463 --> 00:00:18.522
And anything from a check that
errored or didn't run is unverified,

6
00:00:18.522 --> 00:00:20.401
so earlier findings stay open.

7
00:00:20.401 --> 00:00:23.608
Each finding has a fingerprint
that's the same every run,

8
00:00:23.608 --> 00:00:25.700
so there are never duplicate issues.

9
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.986
Issues carry object identifiers,
not people's names,

10
00:00:28.986 --> 00:00:33.170
because the tracker has a wider
audience than the evidence store.
